                                  children: `The development of GetFlagged! is done with a more spontaneous approach. Due to the theming of the game jam that this game is submitted to — that theme being "Nothing Works as Expected" — my team and I  developed the game through the constant brainstorming along with the simultaneous implementation. This project also feels like the most collective work where all of our ideas are bunched up into one in effort to subvert the expectations of the player — which naturally breeds weird ideas. Some are even impossible to implement within the given time frame.`,
