                                  dir: `auto`,
                                  style: { "--framer-text-alignment": `justify` },
                                  children: `We started the development of GetFlagged! — like any other project — by thinking of ideas for the game. The initial concept that we thought of is the idea of a UI element moving instead of the first-person subject in a traditional first-person scene of a video game when a movement input is received. Indeed, this is playful, but naturally, all it is is just an idea and it is not enough to build an entire playable game on.`,
