                                  dir: `auto`,
                                  style: { "--framer-text-alignment": `justify` },
                                  children: `In an attempt to achieve the constant breaking of player expectations, we thought of simply combining our ideas into one. This way, each stage will have a unique solution to a consistent goal, which is capturing the flag. It is no secret that we always seek for patterns in everything we perceive. As players, we expect the first stage to be an introduction, and the second stage continues on the things we learn from the first. This then happens from the current stage onto the next repeatedly. This repetition is not present in GetFlagged!. The beginning of each stage is designed to build a sense of an incoming repetition. `,
