                                  dir: `auto`,
                                  style: { "--framer-text-alignment": `justify` },
                                  children: `This game managed to win 3rd place in the game jam, but I can't resist to question my own stance on whether or not I personally like it. This uncertainty most likely falls into the blurry line that separates between mediocre absurdity and "out-of-the-box" creativity. It is important to clarify that I don't question it in a self-deprecating way, but more of a critical review of it. But in some ways, this game to me feels like one that maximizes the playful nature of video games and how absurd it could be. One may compare it with what people call these days as "ragebait games" — games that breaks expectations and are unpredictable to incite frustration and intrigue at the same time onto the players.`,
